$DATUM tert-Butyl(4R,5R)-4-((1-(((benzyloxy)carbonyl)glycyl-D-alanyl)-1H-indol-3-yl)methyl)-5-((S)-1-methoxy-1-oxopropan-2-yl)-2,2-dimethyloxazolidine-3-carboxylate
(10): To a solution of tert-butyl
(4R,5R)-4-((1-(((benzyloxy)carbonyl)-D-alanyl)-1H-indol-3-yl)methyl)-5-((S)-1-methoxy-1-oxopropan-2-yl)-2,2-dimethyloxazolidine-3-carboxylate
9 (150 mg, 0.24 mmol), Pd(OAc)2 (27 mg, 0.12 mmol), and Et3N (0.07 mL,
0.48 mmol) in dry DCM (5 mL), Et3SiH (0.39 mL, 2.4 mmol) was added
dropwise. Reaction mass immediately changes from colorless solution into
dark black. The mixture was stirred at room temperature under argon for 3
h. Reaction mass was diluted with DCM (10 mL), and saturated aqueous
NH4Cl (5 mL) was added. The aqueous layer was extracted with DCM (2 x 5
mL) and the combined organic extracts were washed with brine (5 mL),
dried over anhydrous Na2SO4 and concentrated in vacuum. Yellow oil. To a
solution of crude amine and Cbz-Gly-OH (55 mg, 0.26 mmol) in dry DCM (10
mL) EDC.HCl (50 mg, 0.26 mmol), HOBt (35 mg, 0.26 mmol), Et3N (0.1 mL,
0.72 mmol) were added and stirred for 14 h at room temperature. The
reaction mixture was diluted with DCM (10 mL), washed with saturated
aqueous NaHCO3 solution (5 mL), H2O (5 mL), brine (5 mL), and dried over
Na2SO4. The crude material obtained after removal of solvent was purified
by column chromatography (silica gel 230-400 mesh, 40% ethyl acetate-pet
ether). 10 as a colorless viscous liquid (0.14 g, 85% over 2 steps). R f
= 0.4 (50% EtOAc-hexanes). [α]D 24 = +40.40 (c = 0.15, CHCl3); IR
υmax(film): cm-1 3318, 2978, 2360, 2341, 1684, 1521; 1H NMR (400 MHz,
CD3OD): δ 8.40 (bs, 1H), 7.86 (bs, 1H), 7.80-7.63 (m, 1H), 7.35-7.22 (m,
7H), 5.37 (d, J = 6.8 Hz, 1H), 5.11 (s, 2H), 4.20 (d, J = 9.3 Hz, 1H),
4.04 (d, J = 9.8 Hz, 1H), 3.97-3.80 (m, 2H), 3.58 (s, 3H), 3.31 (brs, 1H,
merged with methanol peak), 2.91 (t, J = 11.7 Hz, 1H), 2.59-2.45 (m, 1H),
1.56-1.44 (m, 18H), 0.56 (bs, 3H); 13C NMR (100 MHz, CD3OD): δ 173.2,
169.3, 168.8, 156.1, 150.8, 135.2, 134.6, 128.9, 126.6, 126.1, 126.0,
123.6, 122.2, 122.0, 121.7, 117.7, 117.4, 117.2, 115.0, 114.8, 93.6,
92.9, 80.7, 80.1, 79.2, 64.9, 58.6, 57.6, 49.3, 42.9, 41.8, 28.3, 26.9,
26.6, 25.8, 25.5, 15.1, 11.4; MS: 701 (M+Na)+; HRMS calculated for
C36H46N4NaO9: 701.3162, found 701.3152.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
