Nadine; Jotereau, Francine; Baker, Brian M.; Quideau, Stephane
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of Medicinal Chemistry (2010), 53(19), 7061-7066

