$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Protected coupled product 9a: The benzyloxy carbonyl protected amine 6a
(0.200 g, 0.721 mmol) was dissolved in 8 mL of MeOH and 20 mg 10% Pd on
carbon was added and an atmosphere of hydrogen was established with a
balloon. The mixture was stirred at room temperature and pressure for 1 h
and filtered through Celite®. The filtrate was concentrated under reduced
pressure. In a separatory funnel, the dicycohexylamino salt 8 (0.289 g,
0.721 mmol) was suspended in EtOAc and washed two times with 5% KHSO4,
and then with brine. The organic layer was dried with Na2SO4, filtered
and solvent removed under reduced pressure. This acid residue was
dissolved in 4 mL of DMF and added to the amine along with HOAt (0.097 g,
0.721 mmol). The solution was cooled to 0 °C and EDC (0.150 g, 0.783
mmol) was added and the solution stirred at 0 °C for 3 h. The solution
was poured over 1 N HCl and extracted 3 times with EtOAc. The combined
organic layers were washed with water, 5% NaHCO3, and brine. The organic
layer was dried with Na2SO4, filtered and the solvent removed under
reduced pressure. Reverse phase C18 silica gel chromatography was
performed with the following protocol. The column was charged with H2O.
The sample was dissolved in DMSO and added to the column and eluted with
H2O until the DMSO was removed. A gradient elution was done to 75%
MeOH:25% H2O. The coupled product (0.210 g) was obtained in 85% yield
contaminated with approximately 5-10% of the undesired diasteomer
determined by 1H NMR. The residue was recrystallized from MeOH/H2O to
provide 0.137 g of the pure desired product. 9a, yield 0.210 g, 85%. mp =
183-187 °C (dec); 1H NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3) δ 7.84 (1H, br s), 7.30-7.20
(m, 7H), 4.48 (ddd, 1H, J = 1.71, 6.63, 11.34 Hz), 4.29 (t, 1H, J = 7.70
Hz), 3.82-3.64 (m, 2H), 3.30 (dd, 1H, J = 7.41, 13.83 Hz), 2.99 (dd, 1H,
J = 7.49, 14.12 Hz) 2.33 (s, 3H), 2.00-1.35 (m, 6H); 13C NMR (75 MHz,
CD3OD) δ 196.1, 172.1, 170.7, 139.0, 130.4, 129.5, 128.0, 54.3, 53.1,
50.1, 38.5, 31.9, 30.3, 28.7, 27.0; IR (KBr) 3297, 3061, 1922, 1689,
1659, 1622, 1546 cm-1; HRFABMS for C17H23N2O4S (MH+) calcd 351.1379,
found 371.1375.
